{
  "app_id": 3576350,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "In the middle of an ordinary technician's daily routine, every job can conceal a secret no one was ever supposed to discover… Step into the role of a humble electronics repair shop owner. Through countless repair requests, you'll begin to unravel the disturbing truth hidden beneath the surface of Suka City. Through each repair, you slowly uncover their leverage—their secrets, their pasts, and their vulnerabilities. Most people are willing to pay to make problems disappear. But some choose a far more primitive form of transaction… A large number of hidden events are scattered throughout the map. Different choices will alter character relationships and shape the direction of the story. In Suka City, steeped in corruption and raw desire, earn respect from underground. Collect everyone's info, break the chains of backroom deals, and expose the sexy mayor's conspiracy once and for all. Play as an ordinary tech-device repair shop owner. Interact with different cusotmers and explore new events. Discover hidden photos, messages, and secrets buried inside their phones, and make your choices. Keep it quiet. Make your deals. And step into their lives."
  },
